    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom))
    (uuid d66db1c7-371c-4b84-af9a-2a74b218cc29))
  (text
    "bzzy main board rev A: ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U-N16R8, ER-TFT1.69-4 screen, USB-C, clock, 16-LED ring"
    (at 15.24 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 35b7178d-9e53-405f-ad24-202d62d12c31))
  (text
    "Spec: docs/hardware/main-board.md. Pins match the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.69, so the firmware is a new config block."
    (at 15.24 27.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 49e5ff37-9ff3-4b9f-9681-52b3fbb2d554))
  (text
    "1. USB-C and power: CC pull-downs, ESD, polyfuse, 5 V TVS, ferrite, 3.3 V LDO"
    (at 15.24 38.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9f60f8bc-e8cc-4896-9c63-508d9ea1fd05))
  (text
    "2. ESP32-S3 module: EN reset delay, BOOT and RESET switches on the back, test pads for UART and spare GPIOs"
    (at 15.24 111.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 5d13cea1-9870-42e9-bf1b-b0e13ff0c408))
  (text
    "3. Screen: 18-pin FPC to the ER-TFT1.69-4 (ST7789 + CST816 touch). Backlight cathode switched by Q1"
    (at 294.64 111.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 4a83fa57-b9ff-41eb-ba79-bfdb85d85065))
  (text
    "4. Clock: PCF85063A on VRTC (3.3 V via D18, or the supercap when unplugged)"
    (at 294.64 264.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 02883b5a-9636-49a5-85eb-6ede1d0bb868))
  (text
    "5. LED ring: GPIO17 -> 74AHCT1G125 -> 16 x WS2812B-2020 (front). Top button on GPIO18. Buzzer footprint (not fitted)"
    (at 15.24 264.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 4df0dcde-833f-4e32-b0c5-edfd2e346706))
  (text
    "Power flags (ERC)"
    (at 482.6 66.04 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 264250cf-b9af-486f-ab19-45f70b58af7a))
